sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Reader as Reader / Patron
  participant API as ReservationsController
  participant Auth as JWT / RBAC Middleware
  participant Svc as ReservationService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL 16
  Reader->>API: POST /api/reservations (titleId)
  API->>Auth: Verify Bearer JWT and Reader role
  alt Invalid token or unauthorized role
    Auth-->>Reader: 401 Unauthorized / 403 Forbidden
  else Authorized Reader
    API->>Svc: placeReservation(readerId, titleId)
    Svc->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION (SERIALIZABLE)
    Svc->>DB: Lock Reader and Title rows (SELECT FOR UPDATE)
    Svc->>DB: Check eligibility (BR-04, BR-05, BR-06, BR-07)
    alt Eligibility violation (Active loans overdue / Copy available / Hold limit reached)
      DB-->>Svc: Rule violation
      Svc->>DB: ROLLBACK
      Svc-->>Reader: 422 Unprocessable Entity (Business Error)
    else Fully Eligible
      Svc->>DB: INSERT INTO reservations (status='Pending', FIFO queue)
      Svc->>DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
      Svc-->>Reader: 201 Created (reservation details & queuePosition)
    end
  end
